<title>JAPAN: Toyokuni Elec Cable - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyokuni Elec Cable - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.43		vs	    7.85</p>
<p> Operating	  249    mln	  vs	  123    mln</p>
<p> Current	    206    mln	  vs	   65    mln</p>
<p> Net		   92    mln	  vs	   26    mln</p>
<p> EPS		   15.35 yen	  vs	    4.46 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyokuni Electric Cable Co Ltd manufactures cables for electric power and communications.</p>
